Z||000000||Homicidal||08-17-2000||01:21 PM||||What do I need and approx. how much is labor?||||reg||1
Z||000001||1FST2M6||08-17-2000||01:33 PM||||you'll need new Struts (KYB, Koni, Bilstein) and Springs (Jamex, Suspension Techniques, Eibach)... probly $200+ for the labor and another $40 for an alignment. Or you bring the parts and a Case of Corona Extra and a few limes and $40ish for the alignment I'll do it...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 08-17-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Homicidal||08-17-2000||01:50 PM||||How much is the total cost parts + labor.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||08-17-2000||02:58 PM||||I paid $690.00 for Eibach springs, KYB struts, KYB shocks, front and rear KONI sway bars, and poly bushings. Total time was roughly 12 hours of work. So just find out what the shop you want the work done at charges per hour and then add the cost of a 4-wheel alignment. (I did all the labor myself)||||reg||1
Z||000004||1FST2M6||08-17-2000||03:13 PM||||i paid $631 from <A HREF="http://www.shox.com" TARGET=_blank>www.shox.com</A>  for my eibach and Koni kit... and did the install my self with a $40 alignment.. so uum about $680 all together and did the bushings later... DON'T get bushings from the Fiero Store.. go to <A HREF="http://www.nopi.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nopi.com</A>  or call 770-434-0204 ask for Danny or Chris.. about 1/2 the price of the Fiero Store.. for the SAME parts...  ||||reg||1
Z||000005||mshill||08-17-2000||08:01 PM||||I paid $80 for Koni front shocks, Koni rallysport Springs front and rear (similar to ST), 1" front swaybar, 7/8" rear swaybar.  Granted it took me nearly three hours to get all the stuff off the 86 coupe it was attached to but the price was right.  I just love them boneyards.<P>I have been looking at the Eibachs for some time, but at $250 plus shipping I was planning on doing without.  Don't know about labor, but add up the springs and shocks and it is a minimum $500 for just the KYBs and another $200 for the Konis.<BR>||||reg||1
